	<div class="taj">
	<p>Thakur Sureshwari Villa by Thakur Group is located in Borivali West, Andheri to Dahisar Mumbai. Sureshwari Villa renders purity and perfection where life manifests itself in ways that has rarely been explored before.<br /><br />Thakur Group Sureshwari Villa in Borivali West offers the choice of 4 BHK that are meticulously designed and exclusively planned with world class amenities and top line specifications. Price per sq.ft. from 16838-17961 with area of 4454-4454 sq.ft..<br /><br />Dwellers will admire the exquisite villa as it includes a multitude of high-end features and many gorgeous amenities like ...Come and explore what living at Thakur Group Sureshwari Villa is all about. We assure you that the flats in Thakur Group Sureshwari Villa will complement your style of living.</p>	</div>
